OL,3,AGermany puts Ukrainian on trial accused
OL,4,Aof blowing up Nord Stream pipelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour years after one of the most
OL,7,Fdramatic acts of sabotage in modern
OL,8,FEuropean history, a Ukrainian is on
OL,9,Ftrial in Hamburg accused of blowing up
OL,10,FRussia's Nord Stream gas pipelines to
OL,11,FGermany.
OL,13,FSerhii K, as he is identified by German
OL,14,Fprosecutors, is accused of plotting
OL,15,Fwith other Ukrainian military personnel
OL,16,Fto destroy the pipelines and stop
OL,17,FRussia financing its war with gas
OL,18,Frevenue.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
