OL,3,AGermany puts Ukrainian on trial accused
OL,4,Aof blowing up Nord Stream pipelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case is highly sensitive in
OL,7,FGermany, seen as one of Ukraine's
OL,8,Fclosest allies since Russia launched
OL,9,Fits full-scale invasion in February
OL,10,F2022, seven months before the attacks
OL,11,Ftook place.
OL,13,FSerhii K, extradited to Germany last
OL,14,Fyear, is the first suspect to go on
OL,15,Ftrial for the blasts.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
